  "description": "Connect application AI workflows to existing MCP tools without writing a separate function adapter for each server. Mythosia.AI.Mcp discovers tools through a built-in stdio or custom IMcpTransport connection and registers FunctionDefinitions on supporting providers. Includes cooperative cancellation, explicit tool failures and coordinated connection cleanup. This preview requires Mythosia.AI 8.1.0.",
