  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.1.1-preview rebuilds the MCP integration against Mythosia.AI 8.1.0 and transitively Mythosia.AI.Abstractions 4.1.0. Retains existing MCP tool registration, cancellation, failure and connection-lifecycle contracts while using the updated core execution implementation. Existing preview callers require no additional source migration. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/integrations/Mythosia.AI.Mcp/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v011-preview",
